    "turn_text": "We'll be right back. You briefly mentioned AI, which is obviously something that your now former colleagues are contending with. One thing I'm hearing often is that Congress has a different view this time when it comes to AI because they learn from social media, they learn that they can't be hands off, and so they want to be more proactive on AI, and they seem to see some more appetite from industry for AI regulation. I mean, what do you make of that? Because obviously, you're skeptical in general of these tech companies doing the right thing on their own or are I'm guessing being open to regulation.",
